  "status_reason": "Threat-model mitigation T-13 (low-class conflict => quarantine) is [proposed], not ratified (docs/THREAT_MODEL.md; gate G-S is a proposal). Contradicts the paper's P0 admission (nothing below blocked is rejected); the compat profile must keep P0."
